package i18n

// 规则库 (严重日志 → 影响与处置建议) 的英译。
//
// 这是巡检报告里最长的文案块, 也是"要不要照着做"的部分, 所以英译按规则 ID 逐条对齐
// (见测试里对条数与来源的校验), 而不是靠关键词拼。
var ruleEnglish = map[string]string{
	"NFS 场景考虑加 soft,timeo= 避免进程永久卡住": "For NFS, consider soft,timeo= so processes cannot hang forever",
	"OOM killer 直接杀掉了占用内存最多的进程。被杀的通常是数据库或应用主进程,表现为服务突然中断/重启; 未落盘的写入会丢, 正在执行的事务会被回滚。若反复发生, 说明内存长期不足或有泄漏。": "The OOM killer killed the process holding the most memory — usually a database or the main application process. The service stops or restarts abruptly; writes not yet flushed are lost and in-flight transactions are rolled back. Repeated occurrences mean memory is chronically short or leaking.",
	"SCSI 设备不支持被查询的能力 (兼容性提示)":                                                         "SCSI device does not support a queried capability (compatibility notice)",
	"ZFS 存储池降级或故障":                                                                     "ZFS pool degraded or faulted",
	"ZFS 数据校验失败 (checksum mismatch)":                                                   "ZFS data checksum mismatch",
	"df -h 定位是哪个分区, du -xh --max-depth=1 / | sort -h 找占用大户":                            "Use df -h to find the partition, then du -xh --max-depth=1 / | sort -h to find the biggest consumers",
	"iSCSI 存储链路认证/授权失败":                                                                "iSCSI login rejected (auth/authorization)",
	"ip -s link 看错误计数与协商速率, 检查网线/光模块/交换机端口":                                            "Use ip -s link to inspect error counters and negotiated speed; check cable, optics and switch port",
	"journalctl -k | grep -i oom 找被杀进程与当时的内存水位":                                        "Use journalctl -k | grep -i oom to find the killed process and the memory level at that moment",
	"journalctl -u <unit> -n 100 --no-pager 找真正的原因 (常在报错行的上文)":                         "Use journalctl -u <unit> -n 100 --no-pager to find the real cause (often a few lines above the error)",
	"sensors 看具体部位温度与风扇转速":                                                             "Run sensors to see per-zone temperatures and fan speeds",
	"smartctl -a /dev/sdX 看 SMART (重映射扇区、待定扇区、CRC 错误计数)":                               "Check SMART with smartctl -a /dev/sdX (reallocated sectors, pending sectors, CRC error count)",
	"systemctl status <unit> --no-pager -l 看退出码与最近日志":                                  "Run systemctl status <unit> --no-pager -l for the exit code and recent log",
	"zpool scrub <pool> 让 ZFS 把能修的修掉, 修不掉的会列出来":                                        "Run zpool scrub <pool> so ZFS repairs what it can; anything unrepairable will be listed",
	"zpool status -v 看是哪个池、哪些文件受影响, 先把受影响的文件清单记下来":                                     "Run zpool status -v to see which pool and which files are affected, and write the file list into the change ticket",
	"zpool status 确认池状态、缺哪块盘、是否可以 resilver":                                            "Run zpool status to confirm pool state, which disk is missing, and whether a resilver can run",
	"优先清理日志/临时文件, 确认日志轮转 (logrotate) 是否生效":                                             "Clean logs and temporary files first; confirm log rotation (logrotate) is actually working",
	"修复后从备份校验关键数据, 并检查磁盘健康":                                                            "After repair, verify critical data against backups and check disk health",
	"修好后 systemctl reset-failed <unit> && systemctl restart <unit> 并确认自启 (is-enabled)": "After fixing: systemctl reset-failed <unit> && systemctl restart <unit>, then confirm it starts at boot (is-enabled)",
	"停业务 → umount → fsck -y (XFS 用 xfs_repair), 修复前不要再写入":                              "Stop the application -> umount -> fsck -y (xfs_repair for XFS); do not write again before repairing",
	"先区分两类: 内部服务认证失败 vs 外部来源的爆破尝试 (看来源 IP 是否可信)":                                       "First tell the two apart: internal service failures vs brute-force attempts from outside (is the source IP trustworthy?)",
	"内存耗尽, 进程被内核杀死 (OOM)":                                                              "Out of memory — process killed by the kernel (OOM)",
	"内核 panic / oops": "Kernel panic / oops",
	"内核在探测存储设备能力时得到了\"不支持这个可选页\"的回应。这本身不代表读写失败, 常见于 iSCSI 目标、磁带机、虚拟/仿真设备。但同一设备若同时出现 I/O 错误, 就应按设备兼容性/固件问题处理, 而不是当噪音。": "While probing device capabilities the kernel got a “page not supported” reply. By itself this does not mean reads or writes fail — it is common with iSCSI targets, tape drives and virtual/emulated devices. But if the same device also logs I/O errors, treat it as a compatibility/firmware problem rather than noise.",
	"内核已发现文件系统元数据不一致。常见后果是自动转为只读挂载 (Remounting filesystem read-only), 此时一切写操作都失败; 继续使用可能扩大损坏范围。":                      "The kernel found inconsistent filesystem metadata. The usual outcome is an automatic remount read-only, after which every write fails; continuing to use it can widen the damage.",
	"内核级故障。panic 会导致整机宕机或重启 (业务全部中断); oops 可能只影响单个子系统, 但常常伴随功能异常, 且可能反复出现。":                                           "A kernel-level failure. A panic takes the machine down or reboots it (everything stops); an oops may hit only one subsystem, but usually comes with malfunctioning features and tends to recur.",
	"写入失败。数据库可能拒绝新事务, 日志无法落盘, 严重时服务直接退出;根分区写满还会连带影响登录与临时文件创建。":                                                        "Writes are failing. A database may refuse new transactions, logs cannot be written, and in bad cases the service exits; a full root filesystem also breaks logins and temporary file creation.",
	"反复重试会刷满日志, 先修配置再恢复会话 (iscsiadm -m session -R)":                                                                   "Retries flood the logs — fix the configuration first, then restore the session (iscsiadm -m session -R)",
	"取栈回溯 (coredumpctl info) 定位崩溃点, 附版本号提工单":                                                                          "Get the backtrace (coredumpctl info) to locate the crash, and file a ticket with the version",
	"只有伴随 I/O 错误时才需要处理: 更新存储端/设备固件, 或联系厂商确认兼容性":                                                                       "Only act when I/O errors accompany it: update the storage/device firmware, or ask the vendor about compatibility",
	"回顾最近变更: 内核升级、驱动、内核模块、硬件插拔":                                                                                       "Review recent changes: kernel upgrades, drivers, kernel modules, hardware swaps",
	"域场景检查 net ads testjoin / wbinfo -t, 确认域控可达、时间同步 (Kerberos 对时间敏感)、机器账号密码未失效":                                      "In a domain: run net ads testjoin / wbinfo -t, confirm the DC is reachable, clocks are in sync (Kerberos is time-sensitive) and the machine account password is still valid",
	"备份当前能读到的数据, 并记录报错涉及的 inode/块":                                                                                    "Back up whatever is still readable, and record the inodes/blocks mentioned in the errors",
	"复制/主从场景确认延迟与中断原因, 再决定是否重建从库":                                                                                     "For replication, confirm the cause of the lag/break before deciding to rebuild the replica",
	"存储多路径场景检查 multipath -ll 路径状态与超时参数":                                                                               "With multipath storage, check path state and timeouts via multipath -ll",
	"存储池冗余度下降或已失效。降级状态下还能读写, 但再坏一块盘就可能整池不可用;FAULTED 则相关数据集已经读写失败, 跑在上面的服务会报 I/O 错误。":                                  "Pool redundancy is reduced or already gone. In DEGRADED state I/O still works, but one more failed disk can take the whole pool down; in FAULTED state the datasets already fail reads and writes, and services on top report I/O errors.",
	"存储池读出的数据与校验和不符。若冗余副本能修好会自动修复, 修不好说明同一块数据的所有副本都坏了 —— 这类故障是静默数据损坏, 比磁盘直接坏更危险: 文件可能已经读不出来,备份如果建立在同一池上也可能一起坏。": "Data read from the pool does not match its checksum. ZFS repairs it automatically when a redundant copy is still good; if it cannot, every copy of that block is corrupt — silent data corruption, which is more dangerous than a failed disk: the file may already be unreadable, and a backup kept on the same pool can be corrupt too.",
	"必要时先降负载, 再安排停机清灰或更换风扇":                                    "Reduce load first if needed, then schedule downtime to clean or replace fans",
	"怀疑内存问题时对该机做内存检测; 检查是否最近有升级/换库":                            "If memory is suspected, run a memory test on that host; check whether anything was upgraded or relinked recently",
	"怀疑驱动时回退内核版本或改用发行版内核":                                      "If a driver is suspected, roll back the kernel or switch to the distribution kernel",
	"换盘后确认 resilver 完成, 期间避免大压力操作":                             "After replacing the disk, wait for resilver to complete and avoid heavy I/O meanwhile",
	"收集完整日志 (journalctl -k -b -1 看上一次启动的尾部) 与串口/netconsole 输出": "Collect the full log (journalctl -k -b -1 for the tail of the previous boot) plus serial/netconsole output",
	"数据库报出错误。可能是个别语句失败 (业务报错但服务还在), 也可能是崩溃恢复、表损坏、复制中断 —— 后者会影响数据一致性与可用性。": "The database reported errors. It may be individual statements failing (the application sees errors but the service is still up), or it may be crash recovery, a corrupt table or broken replication — the latter affect data consistency and availability.",
	"数据库错误":      "Database errors",
	"文件系统检测到不一致": "Filesystem inconsistency detected",
	"未纠正错误反复出现时, 安排停机检修该硬件": "If uncorrected errors recur, schedule downtime to service that hardware",
	"机器检查异常 (Machine Check) 说明 CPU、内存或总线报错。已纠正的错误(corrected) 通常只影响性能, 未纠正的 (uncorrected) 可能造成静默数据错误或宕机。": "Machine Check exceptions mean the CPU, memory or bus reported an error. Corrected errors usually cost only performance; uncorrected ones can cause silent data corruption or a crash.",
	"查内存大户 (ps aux --sort=-%mem | head) 与 cgroup 用量 (systemd-cgtop)":                                     "Find the biggest consumers (ps aux --sort=-%mem | head) and cgroup usage (systemd-cgtop)",
	"核对 CHAP 用户名/密码两侧是否一致, 是否要求双向认证":                                                                     "Verify the CHAP username/password match on both sides, and whether mutual authentication is required",
	"核对 target 侧的 ACL: 发起端 IQN 是否在白名单里 (targetcli ls 或存储设备管理界面)":                                         "Check the ACL on the target: is the initiator IQN in the allow list (targetcli ls, or the storage management UI)",
	"检查同一设备是否同时有 I/O 错误或性能下降 (dmesg | grep -i \"i/o error\")":                                            "Check whether the same device also shows I/O errors or slower performance (dmesg | grep -i \"i/o error\")",
	"检查固件/BIOS 版本与厂商已知问题":                                                                                "Check firmware/BIOS versions against vendor advisories",
	"检查是否有服务还在用过期密码 (systemctl status 对应 unit)":                                                          "Check whether any service still uses an expired password (systemctl status on the unit)",
	"检查是否有被删除但仍被进程占用的文件 (lsof +L1)":                                                                      "Check for deleted-but-still-open files held by processes (lsof +L1)",
	"检查是盘坏还是链路/背板问题 (同一槽位反复掉盘通常是链路)":                                                                     "Determine whether the disk or the link/backplane is at fault (a slot that repeatedly drops disks usually means the link)",
	"检查硬件: 内存 (ECC/内存检测)、数据线、HBA/背板、电源, 这类错误常源于链路而非盘体":                                                   "Check hardware: memory (ECC / memtest), cables, HBA/backplane, power — these errors often come from the link rather than the disk",
	"检查线缆、背板、HBA 与电源 —— CRC 类错误多是链路问题":                                                                   "Check cables, backplane, HBA and power — CRC-type errors usually mean the link",
	"检查配置语法、依赖服务、端口占用与权限":                                                                                "Check configuration syntax, dependencies, port conflicts and permissions",
	"检查风扇是否停转/积灰、机箱风道与机房温度":                                                                              "Check for stopped or dust-clogged fans, airflow in the chassis, and the room temperature",
	"温度或散热异常": "Temperature or cooling problem",
	"温度超过阈值。CPU 会降频导致性能骤降, 更高时触发保护性关机, 长期高温会加速硬件老化。":                                 "Temperature exceeded its threshold. The CPU throttles and performance drops sharply; higher still triggers a protective shutdown, and sustained heat ages the hardware faster.",
	"爆破类来源用防火墙/fail2ban 封禁, 并禁止 root 密码登录":                                           "Block brute-force sources with the firewall or fail2ban, and disallow root password login",
	"目标端拒绝了发起端的登录。存储卷挂不上或中途掉线,依赖它的文件系统/数据库会挂起或报 I/O 错误; 若是新配的链路, 说明 ACL/CHAP 配置不一致。": "The target refused the initiator's login. The volume cannot attach or drops out; filesystems and databases on top hang or report I/O errors. On a newly configured link this usually means ACL/CHAP settings do not match.",
	"看数据库自己的错误日志 (MySQL: error.log; PostgreSQL: 日志目录) 找完整上下文":                        "Read the database's own error log (MySQL: error.log; PostgreSQL: its log directory) for the full context",
	"短期加 swap 或扩容内存; 若是缓慢增长, 排查连接/缓存泄漏":                                              "Short term: add swap or memory. If usage creeps up over time, hunt for connection or cache leaks",
	"硬件报错 (CPU/内存/总线)":                                 "Hardware errors (CPU / memory / bus)",
	"确认备份与快照策略覆盖当前数据":                                  "Confirm backups and snapshots cover the current data",
	"确认对端设备与中间链路状态, 排查是否有环路或丢包":                        "Confirm the peer and intermediate links; look for loops or packet loss",
	"确认数据可读、备份可用, 准备替换磁盘":                              "Confirm data is readable and backups are usable; prepare a replacement disk",
	"确认数据库进程是否还在 (systemctl status), 以及是否进入了恢复模式":      "Confirm the database process is still running (systemctl status) and whether it entered recovery",
	"确认最近的备份不在同一个池上, 并立即验证备份可读":                        "Make sure the latest backup is NOT on the same pool, and verify right now that it is readable",
	"确认网络可达与端口 (3260), 以及是否被防火墙拦截":                     "Confirm the network path and port (3260), and that no firewall blocks it",
	"确认被杀的是哪个服务, 以及它当前是否已恢复 (systemctl status <unit>)": "Identify which service was killed and whether it has recovered (systemctl status <unit>)",
	"确认这条是哪个设备报的 (lsscsi、sg_inq /dev/sdX 看厂商与型号)":      "Identify which device reports it (lsscsi, sg_inq /dev/sdX for vendor and model)",
	"确认进程与所属服务 (coredumpctl list)":                     "Identify the process and its service (coredumpctl list)",
	"磁盘 I/O 错误": "Disk I/O errors",
	"磁盘读写失败。上层文件系统或数据库会报错, 严重时文件系统会转为只读挂载,业务写入全部失败; 也可能是磁盘即将完全失效的前兆。": "Disk reads or writes are failing. The filesystem or database above reports errors; in bad cases the filesystem remounts read-only and all writes fail. It can also be the prelude to a disk dying completely.",
	"空间不足": "Out of space",
	"立即确认挂载状态 (mount | grep <dev>) 与业务是否还在写入":              "Check the mount state right away (mount | grep <dev>) and whether the application is still writing",
	"系统服务启动或运行失败":                                          "System service failed to start or run",
	"给关键服务设内存上限 (MemoryMax=) 并配置 OOMScoreAdjust, 避免它被优先杀掉": "Set MemoryMax= and OOMScoreAdjust on critical services so they are not killed first",
	"给服务加自动重启 (Restart=on-failure) 作为临时缓解":                 "Add automatic restart (Restart=on-failure) as a temporary mitigation",
	"网卡/链路断开或对端无响应。依赖网络的存储与集群心跳会中断, 可能触发服务切换或进程进入不可中断等待 (D 状态, 表现为命令卡住)。": "A NIC or link went down, or the peer stopped responding. Network-dependent storage and cluster heartbeats break, which can trigger failover or leave processes in uninterruptible sleep (D state — commands appear to hang).",
	"网络链路中断或超时":                                             "Network link down or timing out",
	"若伴随 vdev 错误数增长, 尽快更换对应磁盘":                              "If vdev error counts keep growing, replace that disk soon",
	"若文件系统已只读, 先确保业务停止写入, 再考虑 fsck":                         "If the filesystem is already read-only, stop application writes first, then consider fsck",
	"若涉及表/索引损坏, 先备份数据文件再按官方文档做修复":                           "If a table or index is corrupt, back up the data files first and then repair per the official documentation",
	"若确认无影响, 可在日志过滤里屏蔽这类行, 免得刷满日志掩盖真问题":                     "If it is confirmed harmless, filter these lines so they do not bury real problems",
	"认证失败 (登录被拒)":                                           "Authentication failures (logins rejected)",
	"记录报错地址、Bank 与错误类型 (mcelog / rasdaemon 的输出)":            "Record the error address, bank and type (mcelog / rasdaemon output)",
	"该 unit 未处于运行状态, 它提供的功能当前不可用 (可能表现为端口不通、定时任务不执行、挂载缺失)。": "The unit is not running, so what it provides is unavailable right now (ports unreachable, timers not firing, mounts missing).",
	"账号认证不通过。若是域账号 (winbind/sssd), 说明与域控的通道出了问题 —— 域用户登录、Samba 共享、依赖域的定时任务都会失败; 也可能是外部在暴力破解, 同样会把日志刷满并带来风险。": "Account authentication failed. For domain accounts (winbind/sssd) this means the channel to the domain controller is broken — domain logins, Samba shares and domain-dependent cron jobs all fail. It can also be brute-force attempts from outside, which flood the logs and carry their own risk.",
	"运行内存检测 (memtest86+), 单条内存交叉验证": "Run a memory test (memtest86+) and swap DIMMs to isolate the bad one",
	"进程异常退出 (段错误/崩溃)":               "Process exited abnormally (segfault / crash)",
	"进程收到非法内存访问或主动中止而退出。服务中断; 反复崩溃说明存在稳定复现的缺陷或内存/二进制损坏。": "The process took an illegal memory access or aborted and exited. The service is interrupted; repeated crashes point to a reproducible defect or to damaged memory/binaries.",
	"配置 kdump 以便下次抓到 vmcore; 反复发生时按硬件故障排查 (内存、主板)":       "Configure kdump so the next occurrence yields a vmcore; if it repeats, treat it as a hardware fault (memory, mainboard)",
	"长期方案: 扩容或迁移数据, 并对该分区加容量告警":                          "Long term: grow the volume or move data, and add a capacity alert for that partition",
}

func init() { Register(ruleEnglish) }
